{"t": "n", "id": "doc-f2aqtluz", "rev": 7, "kind": "doc", "key": "CLAUDE.md", "title": "CLAUDE.md", "body": null, "data": {"fam": "harness", "class": "harness", "path": "CLAUDE.md"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-zj2c7o7a", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`stylo_taffy`** — the Stylo ↔ Taffy bridge: `to_taffy_style`, `TaffyStyloStyle`, writing modes\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-z4y3qars", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`blitz-html`** — the HTML parser: `DocumentHtmlParser`, an html5ever `TreeSink`\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-z3xtilm7", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`blitz-net`** — networking: the `Provider` behind `NetProvider::fetch` — HTTP through reqwest, filesystem, `data:` URIs\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-yrl3ploh", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`blitz-paint`** — paints a document through anyrender (`paint_scene`): the open select list last, a password input masked\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-yrb7b5iv", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`blitz-shell`** — the winit application shell: drives any `Document`, refreshes the platform accessibility tree\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-yb5qwsap", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`dioxus-native`** — the native Dioxus renderer: launch configs, a window renderer chosen at compile time\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-yi7vrtgf", "rev": 2, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`blitz-tests`** — the integration tests, one target per behaviour\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-y5f2aywa", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- **`blitz-examples`**\n<!-- GENERATED:setup:modules end -->\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-eet2pkvl", "rev": 3, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- Secrets live only in GitHub Actions secrets and vars — never in source, fixtures, events or committed evidence; never commit `.env*`\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-xhqqmalz", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- The driver session's Unix socket is the one listener: a new socket, port, IPC endpoint or credential path is a security-plan amendment first\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-xfh6gbri", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- No panic path on untrusted input — a driver call's arguments, a stale node id — refuse it or skip it as a typed value, never `unwrap` · `expect` · `panic!` · `unreachable!`\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-wzwdi7tz", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- No content in a log field: `url` · `href` · `src` · `html` · `text` · `value` · `attrs` · `path` · `request` · `error` print `[redacted]` on `escher_*` targets — add no field that carries them\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-vqlmsp2a", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- Every build, test and CI cargo leg passes `--locked` against the committed `Cargo.lock` (`examples/wasm_hello` aside — a standalone workspace)\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-vpuqfdph", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- The workspace takes no git dependency — every crate a crates.io registry version\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-vanviya2", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- Declare a dependency once in `[workspace.dependencies]`, consumed as `{ workspace = true }`\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-uylfi4rs", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- Fallible APIs return typed results\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-ux3ljseg", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- `clippy::unwrap_used` / `clippy::expect_used` are allowed only locally, next to a written justification — never crate-wide\n<!-- GENERATED:setup:warnings end -->\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
