{"t": "n", "id": "fct-xfh6gbri", "rev": 2, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- No panic path on untrusted input — a driver call's arguments — refuse it as a typed value, never `unwrap` · `expect` · `panic!` · `unreachable!`\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-zzxyibdl", "rev": 1, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- `NodeId` is versioned: a dropped node's id stops resolving instead of aliasing a reused slot — a stale id resolves to none on lookup, never a panic\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-vanviya2", "rev": 2, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- Incremental and non-incremental layout must produce identical layouts after any sequence of mutations — the `incremental_oracle` holds them to it\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
{"t": "n", "id": "fct-uylfi4rs", "rev": 2, "kind": "fact", "key": null, "title": null, "body": "- DOM mutations go through `DocumentMutator`, which flushes deferred work on drop\n", "data": {"fam": "harness"}}
